# App Store packaging (Capacitor) — see ios-app/README.md
node_modules/
# www/ is a generated copy of the public site (ios-app/sync-web.js) — never edit it by
# hand, never commit it: it's rebuilt from the real source files on every `npm run ios:sync`.
www/

# Common macOS/Xcode noise, in case the ios/ project (generated on your Mac, not here) is
# ever committed from a machine that doesn't already ignore these itself.
.DS_Store
*.xcuserstate
xcuserdata/
